Oregon State Police's file shows</a>, what that March visit did to me, and =
what your letter did. This is a personal letter. It asks for nothing.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, &quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;=
